WEBVTT

00:56:59.746 --> 00:57:02.579
Is that really a realistic
thing to to dream for?

00:57:02.579 --> 00:57:05.121
And if not, how do you live
up to the mission

00:57:05.121 --> 00:57:07.329
and help ensure that this thing
doesn't go off the rails?

00:57:07.996 --> 00:57:12.496
I think it is. Look, I certainly don't
think we will be the only group to build

00:57:12.496 --> 00:57:14.996
an AGI, but I think we could be the first.

00:57:15.371 --> 00:57:18.913
And I think if you are the first, you
have a lot of norms that empower.

00:57:19.246 --> 00:57:20.538
And I think you've already seen that.

00:57:20.538 --> 00:57:24.163
You know, we have released some of the
most powerful systems to date.

00:57:24.496 --> 00:57:28.704
And I think the way that we have done that
kind of in controlled release where

00:57:28.704 --> 00:57:30.913
we've released a bigger model than
a bigger one than a bigger one,